Read the deployed workload issuer, SPIFFE trust-domain configuration, public CA metadata, and selected server route client-certificate trust without changing cluster resources.

Usage:
  mcp-runtime cluster identity [command]

Available Commands:
  status      Check workload issuer and trust-domain health

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for identity

Global Flags:
      --debug   Enable debug mode with structured error logging

Use "mcp-runtime cluster identity [command] --help" for more information about a command.
